WEBVTT

00:01.434 --> 00:03.724
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.864 --> 00:06.894
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.404 --> 00:10.144
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.144 --> 00:14.774
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.214 --> 00:22.174
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.924 --> 00:26.794
Dragon Drive

00:26.794 --> 00:32.284
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.424 --> 00:35.394
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.394 --> 00:38.624
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.134 --> 00:43.504
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.504 --> 00:45.474
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.474 --> 00:51.774
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.514 --> 00:55.884
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.884 --> 00:59.084
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.424 --> 01:04.424
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.424 --> 01:05.984
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.124 --> 01:08.534
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.534 --> 01:11.654
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.064 --> 01:17.144
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.144 --> 01:19.874
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:19.874 --> 01:27.544
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:44.334 --> 01:47.234
Unless I beat you, I'll never beat Kouhei!

01:47.774 --> 01:51.334
So I must defeat you, no matter what!

02:07.794 --> 02:09.054
I-Incredible!

02:11.994 --> 02:16.154
Now, let's get to it
and finish this game.

02:17.964 --> 02:21.234
The Price of Power

02:31.114 --> 02:33.514
Chibi, what's wrong?! Chibi!

02:39.384 --> 02:41.254
I-I'm falling!

02:57.844 --> 03:00.964
Ch-Chibi. Chibi's...

03:01.874 --> 03:04.644
Let me down! I said let me down!

03:04.914 --> 03:07.284
Canopus. Let him down.

03:17.394 --> 03:18.824
Ouch!

03:18.924 --> 03:20.584
Why's he so hot?!

03:20.764 --> 03:21.924
What's wrong?!

03:23.394 --> 03:25.734
Chibi's so hot, I can't get close to him!

03:28.334 --> 03:29.364
Why, this is...

03:32.674 --> 03:37.804
The one to defeat SinnSaber
will be destroyed by the powers they gain.

03:38.414 --> 03:40.814
It's just like the legend says.

03:41.284 --> 03:42.714
Just like the legend says?

03:43.114 --> 03:44.084
Yes.

03:44.154 --> 03:49.644
He who defeats SinnSaber
acquires its exceptional powers.

03:50.394 --> 03:52.414
However, according to the legend...

03:52.494 --> 03:56.934
...the power becomes too great to control
and it destroys them.

03:57.464 --> 03:59.594
And that's why this dragon is a legend.

04:00.634 --> 04:01.834
Or more like a curse.

04:02.174 --> 04:03.534
A curse?!

04:03.604 --> 04:05.664
I never heard about this legend!

04:06.544 --> 04:08.904
I change my mind,
I don't want SinnSaber's powers.

04:08.974 --> 04:10.844
Can't we do something?!

04:12.384 --> 04:15.974
The reason SinnSaber lives here...

04:16.054 --> 04:19.814
...is because this mountain has an effect
that suppresses the dragon's powers.

04:19.884 --> 04:21.514
An effect that suppresses?

04:21.654 --> 04:22.454
Yes.

04:22.854 --> 04:27.424
I heard that the ores found in this mountain
are what create this effect.

04:27.734 --> 04:28.954
That's it!

04:29.034 --> 04:31.124
Chibi will be saved if we have that, right?!

04:31.464 --> 04:33.334
It's a legend from thousands of years ago.

04:33.404 --> 04:35.804
There's no telling how accurate it is.

04:35.874 --> 04:39.704
Never mind that,
where can I find some of this ore?!

04:39.774 --> 04:41.714
At the peak of that mountain!

04:42.244 --> 04:46.374
They're found within
the rocks and stones found at the peak.

04:47.184 --> 04:48.244
Okay.

04:48.554 --> 04:50.484
Watch Chibi for me, old man!

04:51.224 --> 04:52.114
H-Hey!

04:52.184 --> 04:54.124
Are you planning on climbing that cliff?!

04:54.494 --> 04:55.954
Wait for me, Chibi.

04:56.194 --> 04:57.984
I'll be sure to save you.

04:58.794 --> 05:00.264
Wh-Wh-What's going on?!

05:01.464 --> 05:02.484
Hikaru.

05:02.834 --> 05:04.264
Are you gonna take me there?

05:11.344 --> 05:13.464
Owww...

05:13.544 --> 05:14.404
I'm leaving.

05:15.514 --> 05:18.914
Senkohcoola has acquired new power
from SinnSaber.

05:19.714 --> 05:21.844
Now I need to find such power.

05:22.214 --> 05:24.654
Do you still plan to fight me?!

05:24.784 --> 05:26.914
Kouhei will be back any moment now!

05:26.994 --> 05:28.954
Won't you help me with that battle?!

05:29.154 --> 05:30.524
I'm not interested in Kouhei.

05:30.824 --> 05:33.724
It's not a matter of whether
you're interested or not!

05:33.794 --> 05:36.284
Well, how should I put it...

05:36.364 --> 05:38.764
I need your help.

05:41.034 --> 05:42.334
Please, Hikaru!

05:42.404 --> 05:43.994
Please join forces with me!

05:44.074 --> 05:47.134
If Kouhei returns, and Chibi hasn't
recovered from his present state!

05:48.114 --> 05:52.174
Make sure Senkohcoola is fully recovered
by the time I return.

05:52.414 --> 05:53.384
What?!

05:53.654 --> 05:55.674
That's all I ask.

05:56.284 --> 05:57.254
H-Hey!

05:57.624 --> 05:59.014
Wait, Hikaru!

05:59.084 --> 06:00.244
Hikaru!!

06:02.494 --> 06:03.724
Hikaru!

06:03.824 --> 06:07.264
I'm begging you, and yet you still
refuse to understand! You blockhead!

06:08.494 --> 06:10.694
I should never have asked that guy for help.

06:10.764 --> 06:13.464
I'll save Chibi on my own!

06:16.034 --> 06:19.004
The old man said I needed
the rocks and stones from this area...

06:19.704 --> 06:22.004
I guess this will be enough!

06:23.114 --> 06:24.404
Wait a minute.

06:24.744 --> 06:26.404
How do I get back from here?!

06:27.014 --> 06:28.484
Hikaru!

06:28.554 --> 06:30.714
I'm sorry for calling you a blockhead!

06:30.784 --> 06:33.724
Please get me down from here!

06:49.934 --> 06:54.274
Why's everyone so serious?
They're only training.

06:54.844 --> 06:56.244
And what do you plan to do?

06:56.714 --> 07:00.674
You said it yourself, Kyoji.
This has nothing to do with me.

07:01.784 --> 07:04.374
But if those guys don't win...

07:04.854 --> 07:06.184
...we'll be stuck here as well.

07:06.624 --> 07:08.054
We'll be all right.

07:08.154 --> 07:10.214
There's no way these guys will lose!

07:10.294 --> 07:12.314
And don't forget, they also have Reiji.

07:12.694 --> 07:13.854
You're right.

07:14.434 --> 07:16.554
But Kouhei Toki mustn't be taken lightly.

07:24.974 --> 07:26.334
My sweet honey!

07:28.114 --> 07:30.234
Maiko! How about surrendering?!

07:33.484 --> 07:34.574
You okay, Maiko?

07:34.884 --> 07:37.404
Yes. Thank you, Daisuke.

07:39.424 --> 07:40.484
Don't mention it.

07:40.954 --> 07:43.184
This is it. This is how it should be.

07:43.254 --> 07:47.194
There's no Reiji to get in the way, and
if we go on to defeat Kouhei...

07:47.264 --> 07:49.324
...my sweet honey and I will...

07:52.834 --> 07:53.764
But...

07:54.634 --> 07:57.574
Although everyone's getting
much stronger, it seems like...

07:57.644 --> 07:59.334
...I'm the only one who hasn't improved.

07:59.644 --> 08:02.444
At this rate, I'll just end up
holding everyone else back.

08:02.844 --> 08:04.504
What are you talking about, Maiko?!

08:04.614 --> 08:06.414
You've become a lot stronger, too!

08:06.884 --> 08:08.874
But Gholaoh can't fly.

08:09.014 --> 08:10.284
He may not fly...

08:10.354 --> 08:14.314
...but when it comes to running speed,
no dragon compares to Gholaoh!

08:14.754 --> 08:16.084
You'll do just fine.

08:16.224 --> 08:17.814
We're all on your side.

08:17.994 --> 08:20.794
In particular, I-I'm on your side...

08:20.994 --> 08:22.254
Hey! Daisuke!

08:23.394 --> 08:25.734
That's cheating! Don't kick me from behind!

08:25.934 --> 08:27.094
Shut up!

08:27.234 --> 08:29.294
We're training for the real thing!

08:29.374 --> 08:31.394
There's no such thing as cheating!

08:31.474 --> 08:33.874
Maiko, let's team up to finish him off!

08:33.944 --> 08:35.244
Guys! I need to talk to you!

08:39.144 --> 08:40.344
He's returned!

08:40.554 --> 08:41.814
Kouhei Toki has returned!

08:41.884 --> 08:42.614
What?!

08:43.824 --> 08:46.784
What?! Kouhei Toki has returned?!

08:56.934 --> 08:58.364
Rockaku!

09:12.314 --> 09:13.614
Damn Kouhei.

09:13.684 --> 09:15.584
So he's finally returned to this world!

09:16.014 --> 09:17.814
Elder. Where is this?

09:18.184 --> 09:19.484
I don't know.

09:19.854 --> 09:22.824
This mirror reflects warps in space-time.

09:23.494 --> 09:25.354
It cannot indicate where they happen.

09:25.694 --> 09:26.714
Damn!

09:26.864 --> 09:28.764
That's what we need to know!

09:30.394 --> 09:31.364
Ichirou!

09:31.904 --> 09:34.424
Don't you know where he is?

09:34.634 --> 09:36.264
You came along with him last time, right?

09:36.634 --> 09:39.764
We were on the move as soon as we arrived,
so I don't quite remember.

09:39.904 --> 09:41.504
Tch! That's no help!

09:41.644 --> 09:44.014
You're no better than that mirror.

09:44.284 --> 09:45.774
Even if he did remember, it wouldn't help.

09:45.844 --> 09:46.474
Huh?

09:46.544 --> 09:50.174
He can open a hole in the dimension
anywhere he wishes.

09:50.524 --> 09:52.484
Earlier, you said that the stone Kouhei has...

09:52.584 --> 09:56.084
...is a key to break the seal
to the shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons.

09:56.394 --> 09:58.014
Where is that shrine?

09:58.764 --> 09:59.354
Well...

10:00.094 --> 10:01.524
You don't need to know!

10:01.864 --> 10:03.724
There's no reason for you to know!

10:03.964 --> 10:06.434
But Kouhei knows where it is, right?!

10:06.934 --> 10:10.094
If he knew where it was,
it would have been his first target.

10:11.104 --> 10:12.034
Oh, no!

10:12.304 --> 10:14.294
We must evacuate the priests right away!

10:14.944 --> 10:16.874
Just like when he took the key...

10:17.014 --> 10:19.774
...he'll attack the shrines,
assuming that the priests know something.

10:19.944 --> 10:21.214
Wh-Why, this is!

10:21.484 --> 10:23.454
Wh-What is it, Elder?

10:23.784 --> 10:24.814
Look!

10:30.794 --> 10:32.284
We're too late!

10:32.594 --> 10:35.084
He'll be sure to attack other shrines, too!

10:35.464 --> 10:37.954
We can't just sit around,
let's split up and search for him!

10:38.264 --> 10:42.204
Yeah. Daisuke! You and Maiko
go to the North Shrine!

10:42.504 --> 10:44.994
Taiyou and Ichirou, to the East Shrine!

10:45.074 --> 10:46.434
I'll head out west!

10:46.574 --> 10:47.544
Okay!

10:47.674 --> 10:48.734
Let's go, Maiko!

10:48.814 --> 10:49.774
Mm-hm!

10:55.314 --> 10:59.044
Damn. How could those priests
claim not to know?

10:59.624 --> 11:03.084
I'll just have to go to all of them
until I find what I need.

11:19.944 --> 11:21.234
Hey, Reiji!

11:21.314 --> 11:22.934
Did you find the rocks?!

11:23.014 --> 11:24.774
Are you blind or what?!

11:24.944 --> 11:28.714
I didn't know
how many rocks I needed...

11:28.784 --> 11:31.114
...so it took me a while to get back.

11:33.654 --> 11:35.084
Are you all right, Reiji?!

11:36.824 --> 11:38.254
Never mind me.

11:38.324 --> 11:40.314
How's Chibi doing?!

11:40.964 --> 11:43.094
W-Well...

11:49.804 --> 11:50.794
Chibi...

11:52.344 --> 11:53.304
Reiji!

11:53.544 --> 11:55.104
What do you think you're doing?!

11:55.444 --> 11:56.464
I'm...

11:56.774 --> 11:59.404
I'm gonna make you get better,
okay, Chibi?

12:01.484 --> 12:03.174
Reiji! Don't overdo it!

12:03.814 --> 12:05.214
Damn it!

12:05.354 --> 12:08.484
I'm gonna save Chibi for sure.

12:10.994 --> 12:12.424
Damn!

12:12.524 --> 12:14.824
I'm gonna save you, no matter what!

12:17.194 --> 12:18.464
I'm burning up!

12:18.564 --> 12:20.194
Stop it, Reiji!

12:20.404 --> 12:21.924
You'll both end up dying!

12:30.014 --> 12:31.634
I won't die!

12:31.814 --> 12:33.744
There's no way I'm gonna die!

12:34.314 --> 12:35.284
And Chibi!

12:35.354 --> 12:38.344
I'm not letting you die, either!

12:38.654 --> 12:39.744
Reiji...

12:47.224 --> 12:49.094
Th-The light is getting weaker.

12:49.434 --> 12:53.024
Don't die, Chibi!

13:00.814 --> 13:01.774
Reiji!

13:03.144 --> 13:04.444
Are you all right, Reiji?!

13:04.984 --> 13:05.814
Reiji!

13:07.514 --> 13:09.414
I'm fine, this is nothing.

13:09.484 --> 13:13.444
Forget about me, please look after
Chibi, Mr. Koumei.

13:13.724 --> 13:15.124
Reiji...

13:36.074 --> 13:39.044
So far, there's no sign of him anywhere.

13:45.724 --> 13:46.914
Is it Kouhei?!

13:51.124 --> 13:52.094
No.

13:52.594 --> 13:53.424
Who the hell are you?!

13:56.034 --> 13:56.894
Tch!

13:56.964 --> 13:59.264
You've got some guts, trying to attack me!

13:59.704 --> 14:00.824
Here's your reward!

14:02.234 --> 14:03.764
What's wrong, Thundervolt?!

14:04.204 --> 14:05.534
Why won't you move?!

14:10.074 --> 14:11.274
Why aren't you attacking?!

14:11.544 --> 14:13.204
What's gotten into you, Thundervolt?!

14:19.524 --> 14:20.614
Thundervolt?!

14:26.424 --> 14:27.454
It's quiet.

14:27.694 --> 14:28.664
Yeah.

14:28.894 --> 14:32.354
I'll go to the shrines
and warn them to be cautious.

14:32.904 --> 14:34.194
You stay here and watch for him!

14:35.334 --> 14:36.534
Stop right there!

14:37.404 --> 14:39.034
- Is it him?
- Kouhei Toki?!

14:47.414 --> 14:48.284
Kouhei!

14:48.354 --> 14:50.074
What do you think you're doing to Maiko?!

14:53.324 --> 14:54.654
Here he comes, right on time.

14:54.994 --> 14:56.484
The really passionate one.

15:04.304 --> 15:05.234
Maiko!

15:09.674 --> 15:10.904
Maiko.

15:11.144 --> 15:13.834
You've never been beaten up
really badly, have you?

15:14.844 --> 15:16.144
That's no good.

15:16.444 --> 15:20.344
That's why the other fighters never treat
you as an equal part of their team.

15:23.454 --> 15:24.514
Stop it!

15:25.024 --> 15:27.284
Don't you lay a hand on Maiko!

15:28.094 --> 15:30.114
You're so predictable.

15:31.764 --> 15:33.354
Shut up! Shut up!

15:33.464 --> 15:35.584
Maiko is a full part of our fighting team!

15:42.104 --> 15:43.404
Are you all right, Maiko?

15:43.904 --> 15:46.304
Yes. I'm sorry I let my guard down.

15:46.444 --> 15:48.104
Go and get everyone else, Maiko.

15:48.544 --> 15:50.174
I'll keep him here in the meantime.

15:50.544 --> 15:52.304
- But!
- Don't worry!

15:52.384 --> 15:54.504
I've gotten a lot stronger, too.

15:54.684 --> 15:56.374
I won't let this guy beat me!

15:56.914 --> 16:00.324
You're taking me awfully lightly!

16:00.584 --> 16:01.644
Shut up!

16:01.754 --> 16:03.914
Quit your whining and fight me!

16:04.024 --> 16:06.254
What are you doing, Maiko?! Go!

16:06.324 --> 16:08.024
R-Right.

16:08.964 --> 16:10.224
Are you sure?

16:10.564 --> 16:12.934
With you alone, we'll be done in no time!

16:13.264 --> 16:15.964
Well, why not try and see whether
we'll be done as quickly as you say?!

16:22.444 --> 16:23.434
What a joke.

16:24.584 --> 16:26.914
Was that supposed to be your final move?

16:43.494 --> 16:45.764
Oh, you're up.

16:46.434 --> 16:47.924
You did well.

16:48.204 --> 16:51.134
Thanks to your efforts, this little one
seems to be feeling a lot better.

16:54.714 --> 16:56.674
Hey! Chibi!

17:02.784 --> 17:03.684
Chibi.

17:03.754 --> 17:05.244
You're better.

17:05.384 --> 17:08.014
I was so worried, you know.

17:08.794 --> 17:10.624
Damn! We'd better hurry!

17:12.394 --> 17:13.584
You mustn't move.

17:13.664 --> 17:15.634
You need more time to recover!

17:16.434 --> 17:17.124
Reiji!

17:18.664 --> 17:20.464
I'll be all right!

17:21.004 --> 17:23.364
Thanks for everything, old man.

17:23.834 --> 17:25.394
What are you saying?!

17:25.574 --> 17:26.904
I don't mean just you.

17:26.974 --> 17:29.244
Chibi is still recovering, too!

17:29.744 --> 17:30.974
You heard him.

17:31.214 --> 17:33.144
I'm going, but it's up to you
what you wanna do.

17:34.654 --> 17:36.174
He says he's feeling great!

17:36.484 --> 17:39.754
Can't they consider these things
a bit more seriously?

17:45.124 --> 17:47.454
Okay! Let's go, Chibi!

17:49.064 --> 17:54.664
I hope they're able to control
SinnSaber's powers.

17:57.074 --> 17:58.564
Hey, Thundervolt!

17:58.874 --> 18:01.574
We're not getting anywhere!
What's gotten into you?!

18:08.154 --> 18:10.244
I shall be the one to take your life away!

18:12.554 --> 18:13.854
Die!!

18:14.394 --> 18:15.884
Rockaku!

18:17.294 --> 18:19.124
Tch. An unwanted pest.

18:20.964 --> 18:22.524
Hey, you! Stop!

18:23.064 --> 18:24.864
What's wrong, Thundervolt?!

18:25.034 --> 18:26.694
Hurry up and go after him!

18:27.504 --> 18:28.404
What is it?

18:28.474 --> 18:30.134
Why won't you follow my orders?!

18:30.474 --> 18:31.764
Are you all right, Rockaku?!

18:32.074 --> 18:34.204
Wasn't that Kouhei Toki?!

18:34.774 --> 18:36.214
No, it wasn't.

18:36.674 --> 18:38.074
It wasn't him.

18:41.384 --> 18:43.874
What was that all about?

18:44.454 --> 18:45.714
Everyone!

18:48.924 --> 18:50.514
We have a problem!

18:50.624 --> 18:52.614
Daisuke's fighting Kouhei Toki!

18:55.294 --> 18:57.064
There's quite a difference in our abilities...

18:57.234 --> 18:59.224
...if that's the best you can do.

19:00.334 --> 19:04.494
Just accept that you're an underdog...
and learn your place.

19:05.304 --> 19:07.294
Hah, listen to you talk.

19:08.244 --> 19:10.214
What do you mean,
"difference in our abilities"?

19:10.814 --> 19:14.074
Did you ever stop to wonder why
I acted like I was defeated by you?

19:15.854 --> 19:16.844
An underdog?

19:17.454 --> 19:20.384
I'm gonna make you eat your words!

19:24.764 --> 19:26.994
You're the one
who should know your place!

19:27.894 --> 19:30.794
You never learn, do you.

19:31.404 --> 19:33.734
Do you really want to throw away your life?

19:34.304 --> 19:37.274
That's my line, you idiot!

19:37.734 --> 19:41.734
Let me teach you
who's the fool here!

19:41.814 --> 19:43.364
Daisuke!

19:43.814 --> 19:45.604
Sorry we took so long!

19:45.714 --> 19:47.074
Daisuke!

19:48.654 --> 19:50.444
Looks like my plan worked.

19:50.684 --> 19:53.414
My plan to "Keep the enemy at bay
until my friends arrive".

19:53.484 --> 19:57.084
Mission executed perfectly,
if I say so myself.

19:58.564 --> 19:59.614
Daisuke!

20:00.264 --> 20:01.224
Daisuke!

20:01.334 --> 20:03.294
Bastard! How dare you do this to Daisuke!

20:04.804 --> 20:05.854
Ichirou?

20:06.964 --> 20:07.794
Kouhei.

20:08.274 --> 20:11.794
Sorry, but I'm now part of
this "friendship power".

20:12.904 --> 20:15.204
This side seemed like a lot more fun.

20:17.414 --> 20:19.104
So? I don't care.

20:20.444 --> 20:22.914
I'll just have to fight against you all at once!

20:23.584 --> 20:25.314
Stop!

20:27.554 --> 20:28.644
Kouhei!

20:28.854 --> 20:30.884
I'll be your opponent!

20:31.694 --> 20:32.484
Reiji!

20:32.724 --> 20:33.384
That guy!

20:34.064 --> 20:35.254
Stay back, everyone!

20:35.464 --> 20:38.364
I'll show you what
the legendary power is like!

20:39.064 --> 20:41.664
SinnSaber!

21:09.364 --> 21:10.994
- Wh-What in the world is this?!
- I don't know...

21:16.774 --> 21:17.734
Reiji.

21:23.274 --> 21:25.544
So I was right... he is the "Boss Character".

21:31.624 --> 21:33.454
This is really getting interesting!

21:33.954 --> 21:36.654
A game's gotta have perks like these
to make it fun!

21:56.044 --> 21:58.784
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.784 --> 22:01.554
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.554 --> 22:05.484
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.954 --> 22:09.724
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.724 --> 22:11.884
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.364 --> 22:16.454
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.894 --> 22:20.564
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.564 --> 22:23.304
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.304 --> 22:27.264
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.614 --> 22:31.114
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.114 --> 22:34.114
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.114 --> 22:38.984
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.654 --> 22:42.394
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.394 --> 22:45.164
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.164 --> 22:49.794
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.534 --> 22:53.304
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.304 --> 22:55.974
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.974 --> 23:00.604
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.274 --> 23:05.774
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.714 --> 23:12.384
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.824 --> 23:17.294
Next time

23:18.024 --> 23:19.894
Wow, this is awesome!

23:20.064 --> 23:22.824
With SinnSaber, we're invincible
against any opponent!

23:23.964 --> 23:27.454
What? That man with the sunglasses
is now fighting against Kouhei?

23:27.534 --> 23:28.524
Boom! Bang!

23:28.604 --> 23:31.004
But now he's attacking us!

23:31.474 --> 23:32.374
Okay!

23:32.444 --> 23:34.304
I'll teach him a lesson with SinnSaber!

23:34.844 --> 23:37.404
Next, on Dragon Drive,
"The Mysterious Warrior".

23:37.774 --> 23:40.174
Huh? Something's wrong with SinnSaber.

23:40.514 --> 23:41.484
Could this be...

23:41.484 --> 23:41.914
The Mysterious Warrior

23:41.914 --> 23:43.814
The Mysterious Warrior
The curse?!

23:43.814 --> 23:44.304
The Mysterious Warrior
